    "name": "Automatonics",
    "steam_appid": 2345290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345290/extras/c62b888365559e7f40988fbc13d6ec31.avif?t=1753705019\" /></span><strong>Explore the Depths of a Distant Galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant group of planets may be the solution to host the humans after Earth resources and space are exhausted. The supposedly empty planets are mysterously filled with unfriendly robots. Lead your crew into exploring different planets in search of resources for Earth and solving the mysteries surounding the inhabitant robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatonics is a beautiful 2D action adventure styled around different planets. Explore unexpected environments; battle mysterious robots and solve the mysteries to bring hope back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling action/adventure, alongside beautiful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five mysterious planets in search of a new home for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master weapons and abilities to overcome enemies and barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your parts, become stronger, faster and more adaptable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your companion droid and face the challenges that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op to beat enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful styled colorful worlds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345290/extras/c62b888365559e7f40988fbc13d6ec31.avif?t=1753705019\" /></span><strong>Explore the Depths of a Distant Galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant group of planets may be the solution to host the humans after Earth resources and space are exhausted. The supposedly empty planets are mysterously filled with unfriendly robots. Lead your crew into exploring different planets in search of resources for Earth and solving the mysteries surounding the inhabitant robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatonics is a beautiful 2D action adventure styled around different planets. Explore unexpected environments; battle mysterious robots and solve the mysteries to bring hope back to Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-scrolling action/adventure, alongside beautiful environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore five mysterious planets in search of a new home for humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master weapons and abilities to overcome enemies and barriers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your parts, become stronger, faster and more adaptable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with your companion droid and face the challenges that await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or co-op to beat enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful styled colorful worlds.</p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by games like Super Mario and Megaman, in this adventure a little round robot is on a mission to save Earth. Lead your crew into exploring different planets in search of resources, fight enemy robots, collect different power-ups and upgrade your powers, while solving the planets' mysteries.",
